# Verification (Laboratory 5, section 4.5; Delivery 4): graph, structural properties,
# simulation and report per model. The other programs run with --entrypoint python
# (correspondence.py, sos_compose.py, tactics_check.py); see README.md.
FROM python:3.11-slim
WORKDIR /app
COPY requirements-verification.txt .
RUN pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements-verification.txt
ENTRYPOINT ["python", "verification.py"]
